# kém ("less") names the hour being APPROACHED and subtracts from it:
# "ba giờ kém mười" is 02:50, ten to three.  Mirror image of rưỡi, which
# counts forward from the hour it names; both idioms are in daily use and
# neither direction can be made the locale's default.
# en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/k%C3%A9m and https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ph%C3%BAt
# ("4 giờ kém 5 phút" == 5 to 4).
kém
